OL,3,AMillions to get #100 energy payment
OL,4,Aafter Budget as OBR says disposable
OL,5,Aincomes unlikely to grow
OL,6,
OL,7,FHealey says there will be "fiscal
OL,8,Fdevolution", with business rates
OL,9,Fretained locally by the end of the
OL,10,Fdecade and mayors getting a share of
OL,11,Fincome tax from 2028
OL,13,FMeanwhile, there are tax rises on some
OL,14,Fsavings and rental profits
OL,16,FThe OBR says it's a grim picture on
OL,17,Fhousehold incomes, with not much growth
OL,18,Fin disposable incomes forecast in the
OL,19,Fnear term
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
