OL,3,AAt least 68 killed in Spanish
OL,4,Ahigh-speed train crash, as prime
OL,5,Aminister says 'whole country is
OL,6,Agrieving'
OL,7,
OL,8,FWitnesses have described "terrible"
OL,9,Fscenes, while Roberto Gomez, a Spanish
OL,10,Fjournalist travelling on one of the
OL,11,Ftrains, says it was "extremely chaotic
OL,12,Fand very distressing"
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
