OL,3,AFlavio Bolsonaro seen landing in Miami
OL,4,Awith family after Brazil presidential
OL,5,Aelection defeat
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrazil's Flavio Bolsonaro has landed in
OL,8,Fthe US - watch the moment he disembarks
OL,9,Ffrom the plane
OL,11,FThe defeated presidential candidate is
OL,12,Fjoined in Florida by his wife and two
OL,13,Fdaughters - here's how this wild
OL,14,Fjourney began
OL,16,FFrom Argentina to Ecuador, we tracked
OL,17,Fthe Bolsonaro family's round-about
OL,18,Froute to Miami
OL,20,FEarlier this week, Bolsonaro had failed
OL,21,Fto comply with a Brazil Supreme Court
OL,22,Forder to surrender his passports
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
